flowchart TD
    Start([Round start])
    Agent[Agent inference + decisions]
    Apply[Apply decisions to state]
    State[(Company state<br/>cash · capacity · brand · models · research)]
    Variables[(Variables<br/>market size · price sensitivity · base costs)]
    Compute[Compute market outcome<br/>share · demand served · revenue · burn]
    Check{Bankrupt or<br/>round limit?}
    EndN([End])

    Start --> Agent
    Agent --> Apply
    Apply --> State
    State --> Compute
    Variables --> Compute
    Compute --> State
    State --> Check
    Check -->|no| Start
    Check -->|yes| EndN

    Situations((⚡ Situations)):::sit -.->|modify| State
    Situations -.->|modify| Variables

    classDef sit fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#d79b00
